OL,3,GNEWSAChild in critical condition
OL,4,Afollowing two-vehicle collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child is in a critical condition
OL,7,Ffollowing a road collision near
OL,8,FMarkethill, County Armagh, on Saturday.
OL,10,FThe collision, involving two cars, one
OL,11,Fof which was towing a caravan, happened
OL,12,Fon the Cusher Road at about 13:20 GMT.
OL,14,FThree children were taken to hospital
OL,15,Ffor treatment. Two of the children
OL,16,Fsustained minor injuries, police have
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FA woman in her 30s was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of dangerous driving causing
OL,21,Fgrievous bodily harm and driving while
OL,22,Funfit through drink or drugs.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
